nfidence without harsh aluminum? ✨Meet your 2026 daily essential—the 24H Antiperspirant Deodorant Stick. Clean, gentle, fresh all day. 🍦🌸 All-Day Fresh Care: 24h bio-odor defense, aluminum-free, smooth glide with no streaks or stickiness, skin-friendly botanical extracts, light vanilla & pistachio scent, portable for travel. Stay fresh, confident, and comfortable—grab yours now!\",\"transcript\":\"Armpit brightening, no white residue, no yellow marks, and it smells like a freaking summer dream. MediCube, what are you doing? I think you're just secretly dropped a new deodorant. 24 hours of coverage, moisturizing, kojic acid, and turmeric for brightening, and then it doesn't have any of that nesty stuff like baking soda, parabens, or even aluminum. And this smells so good. Literally giving summer vibes. Vanilla, pistachio, almond, hint of jasmine. That smells so freaking good. And it's a stick. I hate the liquid ones because they make my armpit so sticky. This is hot off the press, and this is going to blow up. If you want to snag it, I'm going to link it for you.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://www.britiyaituk.com/pages/deodorant-antiperspirant-balm-vanilla-pistachio-y-2\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"britiyaituk.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"The Hidden Truth Behind Dark Underarms (And the Balm That's Changing Everything)\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":692,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":6,\"duplicates\":88,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":23},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"GB\",\"IE\"],\"mainCountry\":\"IE\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":324,\"currentRank\":324,\"rankDelta\":null,\"improvementPct\":11.24},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":true,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1123016080298253\",\"collationId\":\"1299395895738146\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"c