{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VBvruXRPFJqsxGcBh8tvdq","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"a38f4f43-55a3-4fed-be08-1114ba04443f\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1183122723894842\",\"collationId\":\"1924039814916226\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-26T01:48:24.303Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-05-21T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-05-31T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":10,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/59d9b6f0d8a061eb3dfb140ac1e9234fc53277b80954966857d473995dde2e51.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/ef6179f8c5541dea9d7c5a294f4b5b07f2067fb13ebbb0e4a93592856ac8ba71.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"106715042155923\",\"name\":\"Heyisail\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/106715042155923.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"106715042155923\",\"liveAdsCount\":313,\"reach30d\":72565,\"totalReach\":270665,\"countriesCount\":null,\"facebookLikes\":6684,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Stressed about sweat stains or dark underarms ruining your look? 😩 This Vanilla & Pistachio Deodorant Balm naturally blocks odor for 24H while gently fading dark spots. 🌿✨ The creamy, aluminum-free formula glides on clear—no white marks, no sticky residue. Just a warm, cozy scent that lingers all day. Smell like a snack and feel confident! 💚 https://reurl.cc/Dx7kOE\",\"transcript\":\"let me know why it took the girls 30 freaking years to figure out how to lighten their armpits and no it's not laser okay this is my transformation after two weeks of kojic acid and turmeric so the fact that they finally stuck that ingredient in a freaking deodorant that same celebrity brand that's always sold out on this app came out with a freaking lightening deodorant i've gone out twice in this stuff twice and i do not need to wear perfume like that's how long the freaking smell lasts like when i say it smells like luxury like vanilla girl rich bitch just got off vacation and freaking bora bora and it lightens your armpits literally sold out on like day two or three of launch so when i say i am literally stocked up if you can grab one i would run but right now they're giving away a little baby like travel size deodorant if you buy two of them look how cute it is and with the way these are selling out i don't think it's gonna last until the freaking summer you you you you you you you you\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://m.arichbox.com/funnel/news-deodorant---antiperspirant-balm---vanilla---pistachio\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"m.arichbox.com\",\"ctaDescription\":null,\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":1935,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":null,\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":true}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1493051085016911\",\"collationId\":\"1058945116453924\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2025-08-08T04:24:35.750Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2025-08-07T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2025-09-03T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":27,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/32effb5e04a4e61f596e52be7b050a40238e56b2e579bf4ddda98b083a220b66.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/225fd2c0c548bff59b9152be41b59858df20626cfe38ad26cb7b1b0a6199192e.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"100331619661781\",\"name\":\"Predominantk.shop\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/100331619661781.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"100331619661781\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":466,\"totalReach\":13717,\"countriesCount\":null,\"facebookLikes\":527,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"If you want healthy skin,exfoliation is key.🌟unveils your natural beauty dffortlessly.!\\n✨ Try our to get your confidence back!\\n🌟 These gels are made from 100% natural ingredients and are designed to support clean, healthy skin.\\n📊 Studies have shown that using this product helps remove dark spots, hyperpigmentation, dark neck, dark underarms, dark knees, dark elbows.\\n💖 Rejuvenate your skin and embrace a beautiful life!\\n⏳ Limited time special with limited stock! Buy now and refresh your skin!\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://www.predominantk.com/products/exfoliating-gel-3-1-2\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"predominantk.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Purifying Exfoliating Gel\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":1740,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":null,\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1000549732478460\",\"collationId\":\"1360329245983357\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-03T02:58:25.257Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-06-02T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-06-05T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":3,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/374e6e21c3f5f8538a5e5987d2c991e43026bfb1547b08768c8ed391b6b59b20.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/af9f44f00fc1b4d90630e65ecbad0bbd268860e89ffeaa67a301a4c1e787dd7f.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1150172021506055\",\"name\":\"Vibeourplus-online\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1150172021506055.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":