.\",\"isFallback\":false},\"hookPattern\":\"benefit_led\",\"hookPatternReason\":\"Leads with a product benefit.\",\"trajectory\":\"unknown\",\"verdict\":\"This ad looks wound down; treat it as a historical creative rather than a live scaler.\"},\"data\":{\"id\":\"facebook_1000074609583289\",\"collationId\":\"2401372100348897\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-24T01:19:55.042Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-06-22T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-07-04T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":12,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/7f207a9a2b1711bdf168264bbb580e89a85bc93292a075e768c965d9f1b75524.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/f42f1e3b74c77b4b3e25cd02c2eca921ba335c3327f11aa3af758ab39f75be1d.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"109648188179835\",\"name\":\"Flameday\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/109648188179835.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"109648188179835\",\"liveAdsCount\":13,\"reach30d\":94183,\"totalReach\":6128555,\"countriesCount\":7,\"facebookLikes\":2975,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"☀ Want to smell like a literal walking dessert while staying completely fresh and dry all day? 🍦💚 Meet your new daily obsession: Vanilla & Pistachio Deodorant & Antiperspirant Balm! It’s the ultimate upgrade from those chalky, chemical-heavy sticks. 🙌✨\\n\\n🎯 24-Hour Odor & Sweat Control: Keeps you confidently dry from your morning workout to a late-night date.\\n🍦 The Dreamiest Scent Combo: Warm, sweet, and nutty. Prepare to get complimented everywhere you go!\\n🌿 Nourishing Balm Texture: Applies smoothly like cream, leaves 0% white residue, and deeply moisturizes your underarms.\\n🌱 Skin-Loving Formula: Cruelty-free and gentle on sensitive skin. No harsh irritation, just pure comfort.\",\"transcript\":\"If your man can't do this to your armpits, you need to get a new deodorant. And this is coming from a girl who armpits used to look like this and now look like this. That aluminum deodorant, yeah, it's causing the darkness. This is my transformation with kojic acid and turmeric, and they put it in a freaking lightning deodorant. This is Kylie Kardashian's favorite skincare brand. When I say this is my husband's favorite scent, I'm not kidding. Tastes like pineapple, pistachio, vanilla. It smells like the richest girl you've ever met. And if anybody says this lasts for 48 hours, they're lying because as a girl who works out and goes to the gym, this only lasts for 24 hours on me. Even after working out, my husband will gladly smell my armpit. Smell amazing, it's lightening my underarm, and it lasts for 24 hours, so I would freaking run. And because this is like a summery type of product, they have like a summer sew going on, so if you wanted to try it, now is the time.\",\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://m.newsparkings.com/funnel/news-deodorant---antiperspirant-balm---vanilla---pistachio\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"m.newsparkings.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Newsparkings\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":\"🔥Festivel Hot SALE👉+ 90 Day Guarantee✔\"},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":67670,\"aggregatedReach\":67670,\"estimatedSpend\":609,\"duplicates\":2636,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":0},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"CH\",\"DE\",\"DK\",\"FI\",\"FR\",\"IT\",\"NL\"],\"mainCountry\":\"DE\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":21,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":true},\"transcript\":{\"language\":\"en\",\"languageConfidence\":1,\"segments\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":4,\"text\":\"If your man can't do this to your armpits, you need to get a new deodorant.\"},{\"start\":4.04,\"end\":8.28,\"text\":\"And this is coming from a girl who armpits used to look like this and now look like this.\"},{\"start\":8.36,\"end\":10.9,\"text\":\"That aluminum deodorant, yeah, it's causing the darkness.\"},{\"start\":11.08,\"end\":16.22,\"text\":\"This is my transformation with kojic acid and turmeric, and they put it in a freaking lightning deodorant.\"},{\"start\":16.3,\"end\":18.46,\"text\":\"This is Kylie Kardashian's favorite skincare brand.\"},{\"start\":18.52,\"end\":21.6,\"text\":\"When I say this is my husband's favorite scent, I'm not kidding.\"},{\"start\":21.6,\"end\":24.26,\"text\":\"Tastes like pineapple, pistachio, vanilla.\"},{\"start\":24.84,\"end\":26.740000000000002,\"text\":\"It smells like the richest girl you've ever met.\"},{\"start\":26.740000000000002,\"end\":31.980000000000004,\"text\":\"And if anybody says this lasts for 48 hours, they're lying because as a girl who works out and goes to the gym,\"},{\"start\":32.04,\"end\":33.96,\"text\":\"this only lasts for 24 hours on me.\"},{\"start\":34.02,\"end\":36.96,\"text\":\"Even after working out, my husband will gladly smell my armpit.\"},{\"start\":37.06,\"end\":41.72,\"text\":\"Smell amazing, it's lightening my underarm, and it lasts for 24 hours, so I would freaking run.\"},{\"start\":41.800000000000004,\"end\":45.88,\"text\":\"And because this is like a summery type of product, they have like a summer sew going on,\"},{\"start\":45.900000000000006,\"end\":47.68000000000001,\"text\":\"so if you wanted to try it, now is the time.\"}],\"fullText\":\"If your man can't do this to your armpits, you need to get a new deodorant. And this is coming from a girl who armpits used to look like this and now look like this. That aluminum deodorant, yeah, it's causing the darkness. This is my transformation with kojic acid and turmeric, and they put it in a freaking lightning deodorant. This is Kylie Kardashian's favorite skincare brand. When I say this is my husband's favorite scent, I'm not kidding. Tastes like pineapple, pistachio, vanilla. It smells like the richest girl you've ever met. And if anybody says this lasts for 48 hours, they're lying because as a girl who works out and goes to the gym, this only lasts for 24 hours on me. Even after working out, my husband will gladly smell my armpit. Smell amazing, it's lightening my underarm, and it lasts for 24 hours, so I would freaking run. And because this is like a summery type of product, they have like a summer sew going on, so if you wanted to try it, now is the time.\"},\"creativeAnalysis\":{\"hook\":{\"text\":\"If your man can't do this to your armpits, you need to get a new deodorant.\",\"source\":\"ad_transcripts_hook\",\"sourceDescription\":\"Existing completed ad transcript hook.\",\"isFallback\":false}},\"links\":{\"adLibraryUrl\":\"https://www.facebook.com/ads/library/?view_all_page_id=109648188179835&id=1000074609583289\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://m.newsparkings.com/funnel/news-deodorant---antiperspirant-balm---vanilla---pistachio\"},\"shops\":[{\"shopId\":\"11e5513c-fdbb-4727-8a2c-4f9a292b99cd\",\"domain\":\"m.flameday.co.uk\",\"name\":null,\"isPrimary\":true,\"traffic\":7164,\"categories\":null},{\"shopId\":\"1f125afa-d689-4a7b-987a-112dd681744b\",\"domain\":\"m.kiwient.com\",\"name\":null,\"isPrimary\":false,\"traffic\":317,\"categories\":null},{\"shopId\":\"2bc79ea1-fcb0-4764-b6b1-68aed3a9652c\",\"domain\":\"gohomie.co.uk\",\"name\":\"gohomie\",\"isPrimary\":false,\"traffic\":165882,\"categories\":null},{\"shopId\":\"4d2a91ef-a072-4849-a595-055b6859ea8a\",\"domain\":\"m.newsparkings.com\",\"name\":null,\"isPrimary\":false,\"traffic\":37650,\"categories\":null},{\"shopId\":\"6cf8bfb9-d458-42da-a5b9-8f742ce1a2be\",\"domain\":\"funnel.gohomie.co.uk\",\"name\":null,\"isPrimary\":false,\"traffic\":138362,\"categories\":null},{\"shopId\":\"86c4407c-2470-43c4-841e-e6318b70ff38\",\"domain\":\"pearlinu.com\",\"name\":null,\"isPrimary\":false,\"traffic\":0,\"categories\":null},{\"shopId\":\"a4d58edf-2660-49bd-88cf-169b27739bc9\",\"domain\":\"kiwient.com\",\"name\":\"kiwient\",\"isPrimary\":false,\"traffic\":317,\"categories\":null},{\"shopId\":\"bd87fc42-bc94-4999-9