 on.\\\"\\nThat was me 3 months ago. Dark shirts only. Arms glued to my sides in photos.\\nThen Verbelle dropped this deodorant. Skincare INSIDE a deodorant. I'm not exaggerating when I say it changed my life.\\nKojic Acid. Turmeric. Niacinamide. The ingredients facials charge $200/session for — now in a stick I swipe on every morning.\\nWhat changed in 14 days:\\n\\n✅ Underarms visibly brighter (I have photos)\\n✅ Smells like luxury — vanilla + pistachio + sandalwood\\n✅ Aluminum-free, doesn't burn after shaving\\n✅ Doesn't stain white tees OR dark camis\\n✅ Stays fresh from 6am to midnight\\n\\nHonestly? You don't need perfume when you wear this. It IS the perfume.\\nP.S. It was sold out last week. Run.\\n\\n— Marissa T. ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️.  \\n\\n👉 https://tryverbelle.com/products/kojic-acid-turmeric-deoderant\",\"transcript\":\"word on the street is your girl got some pretty underarms i'm a girl's girl so i'ma tell y'all exactly what i do no because why did it take us forever to figure out that the reason our armpits are dark is because we're using aluminum once i stopped using aluminum my armpits went from this to this mind you this is only after a month took me forever to figure this out i was using lume which literally broke me out in hives i tried mitchum but they reformulated and it stopped working for me and i also tried native which i don't think has aluminum but it's not consistent and sometimes i'm still funky at the end of the day but then i'm randomly doom scrolling on and this girl pops up on my for you page talking about this korean deodorant when i tell you switching to korean deodorant game changer because koreans literally broke it down to a science and included turmeric which we all know helps light in dark areas and they included kojic acid which is the main ingredient in those booty bleaching creams that stop smelling in production and y'all when i tell you this is the best smelling deodorant i have ever used it has a vanilla pistachio scent i don't e