{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011cX3QDFq8BLaardGnriEt7","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"2342ddf8-25a8-46f4-a16d-0e8144795286\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1621229446441708\",\"collationId\":\"987776887280636\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-24T10:28:20.683Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-23T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-27T09:52:52.838Z\",\"daysRunning\":5,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/374a976d45d4060fa0d57f6b673792199024fd1de7c0d340f1be29db69484d6f.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/bc85d163c5bb8c06b341028e5b719e8b9fd01fb7326ed0f8de010fd0344a7f35.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"655777234286412\",\"name\":\"Queens Elite Medical\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/655777234286412.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"655777234286412\",\"liveAdsCount\":86,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":0,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":852,\"instagramFollowers\":3611},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Laser Hair Removal Aftercare Tips You Shouldn’t Skip!\\n\\nYour skin needs extra care after laser treatment 💆\u200d♀️\\n✅ Avoid heat, workouts, and saunas for 24–48 hours\\n✅ No makeup or deodorant on treated areas\\n✅ Skip hot showers — keep it cool & clean\\n✅ Always apply SPF 30+ and avoid sun exposure for a week\\n✅ Keep skin moisturized, and gently exfoliate after a few weeks for that healthy glow \\n\\nYour smooth, radiant skin starts with the right aftercare \\n📍 Queens Elite Medical, Dubai Marina\\n📲 +97143990402 / +971505865747\\n\\n#LaserHairRemoval #LaserAftercare #SmoothSkinTips #DubaiClinic #QueensEliteMedical #SkinCareDubai #LaserTreatmentDubai #BeautyClinicDubai #HairFreeSkin\",\"transcript\":\"Today, we'll talk about the aftercare tip for laser hair removal. First, keep the area cool and clean. No makeup, no deodorant, and heat for 24 hours. And the second tip: avoid sun exposure or tanning for at least a week, or always apply SPF 30 or higher. Third, due to skin sensitivity, no hot shower, sauna, and workouts for a couple of days. And the last tip is always keep your skin moisturized. And after a few weeks, gently exfoliate your skin to get that smooth and healthy glow. Your skin deserves a plan made for you. I'm Carla, and I'm here at Queens Elite Medical. Book your laser session today.\",\"callToAction\":\"WHATSAPP MESSAGE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://api.whatsapp.com/send\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"api.whatsapp.com\",\"ctaDescription\":null,\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":1,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AE\"],\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":{\"positionInPage\":31,\"currentRank\":31,\"rankDelta\":6,\"improvementPct\":36.05},\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":true}}],\"pagination\":{\"page\":1,\"limit\":1,\"total\":16,\"totalPages\":16,\"offset\":0,\"isTotalApproximate\":false},\"meta\":{\"query\":null,\"keywords\":[\"deodorant\",\"laser\"],\"searchIn\":\"ad_copy\",\"categoryIds\":[],\"country\":null,\"countryFilterKind\":\"audienceCountry\",\"adCountries\":null,\"mainCountries\":[],\"trendSignal\":\"reach_growth_7d\",\"sortBy\":\"newest\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"requestedLimit\":1,\"effectiveLimit\":1,\"activeOnly\":true,\"status\":\"active\",\"page\":1,\"minTrafficGrowthPercent\":null,\"trafficGrowthPeriod\":\"last30d\",\"trafficGrowth\":null,\"adsGrowth\":null,\"pageReachGrowth\":null,\"adReachGrowth\":null,\"language\":null,\"adLanguages\":[],\"cta\":[],\"currency\":null,\"currencies\":[],\"shopifyAppIds\":[],\"excludeShopifyAppIds\":[],\"pixelIds\":[],\"excludePixelIds\":[],\"themeIds\":[],\"filters\":{\"search\":[\"deodorant\",\"lase