{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ph5UghiHxragRHCCpZVX6B","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"76084a69-b19d-4506-8c1c-1d7e0ae569f4\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1160467973148420\",\"collationId\":\"1129832869653384\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"active\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-26T11:56:02.404Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-11-26T08:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-11-26T11:56:27.693Z\",\"daysRunning\":2,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/988efa7abfe9f02c465164c04785f62b0ba51e538aa12533a1a6152a0cd2587c.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/c064045f8aa3f059c4788564126bed57e68ea54cd1d297ce370a7e0a15e609f9.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1584463105178080\",\"name\":\"HYGR.my\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1584463105178080.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1584463105178080\",\"liveAdsCount\":366,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":0,\"countriesCount\":null,\"facebookLikes\":17936,\"instagramFollowers\":87083},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Ever sat down next to someone and quietly leaned away, just in case they catch a whiff of you?\\n\\nYou've switched deodorants so many times you've lost count. The sprays, the roll-ons, the \\\"long lasting\\\" ones. They sit on top of the smell for an hour and then give up.\\n\\nThe HYGR Natural Refillable Deodorant is built differently. Heavy-duty, aluminium-free, made for intense sweat and stubborn body odour.\\n\\n- Tackles heavy odour at the root: it doesn't just mask smells. The botanical formula actively targets and neutralises the bacteria that causes heavy body odour, keeping you genuinely fresh for a full 24 hours.\\n- 100% aluminium-free: real odour protection without plugging your pores with harsh metals. No clogged sweat glands, no painful irritation, no yellow pit stains on your clothes.\\n- Stands up to the heat: formulated to survive extreme tro